  "dcterms:title": "IMMZD2DTTBEFSMEImmun ValueSet for Decision Table",
  "dcterms:description": "ValueSet IMMZD2DTTBEFSMEImmun for IMMZ.D2.DT.TBE.FSME-Immun. Business rule: Determine if the client is due for a tick-borne encephalitis (TBE) vaccination according to the national immunization schedule Trigger: IMMZ.D2 Determine required vaccination(s) if any Table: FSME-Immun schedule (In areas where the disease is highly endemic, implying that there is a high individual risk of infection, WHO recommends that vaccination be offered to all age groups, including children)",
